WEBVTT

01:25.970 --> 01:31.600
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.230 --> 01:39.590
[Episode 30: Stronger Attacks from the Enemy]

01:45.110 --> 01:47.086
You not only screwed it up,

01:47.110 --> 01:49.060
but also caused one of my trusted subordinates to die for nothing.

01:49.340 --> 01:50.496
Yun Xiang.

01:50.520 --> 01:52.480
I overestimated you.

01:53.179 --> 01:54.870
Are you going to kill me?

01:59.140 --> 02:01.780
Maybe.

02:08.929 --> 02:10.520
If you don't want to kill me,

02:11.050 --> 02:12.500
sit down and let's talk.

02:21.140 --> 02:24.580
Lingyuan Sect is much different now.

02:25.610 --> 02:27.166
You even managed to bring Prince Fu on board.

02:27.190 --> 02:28.640
Bastard!

02:29.210 --> 02:31.706
Lingyuan Sect and the illegitimate reign are bitter enemies!

02:31.730 --> 02:33.890
How would we get involved with those jerks?

02:34.180 --> 02:35.706
Then,

02:35.730 --> 02:36.850
the Kou family didn't know

02:36.870 --> 02:39.390
Nangong Fang had colluded with Prince Fu either.

02:40.670 --> 02:42.906
I've warned about his disloyalty

02:42.930 --> 02:44.900
and advised to kill him to save future problems.

02:44.950 --> 02:46.590
But no one believed me.

02:47.860 --> 02:49.606
This makes sense then.

02:49.630 --> 02:51.296
It seems that Prince Fu was the one

02:51.320 --> 02:54.240
who got those two royal decrees to put the Su family in its place

02:54.350 --> 02:56.410
and pave the way for Nangong Fang.

02:56.480 --> 02:59.090
Nangong Fang relies on Prince Fu

02:59.290 --> 03:01.510
to build most of his networks in Jiangnan.

03:03.270 --> 03:05.200
But I don't understand

03:06.240 --> 03:07.780
what benefits colluding with Lingyuan Sect

03:08.300 --> 03:10.840
could bring to Prince Fu.

03:11.610 --> 03:13.130
Do you mean that

03:14.380 --> 03:17.720
Prince Fu may not know the real identity of Nangong Fang?

03:21.150 --> 03:22.600
Anyway.

03:23.990 --> 03:25.870
We might as well continue to work together

03:26.110 --> 03:28.540
and make plans accordingly when the right time comes.

03:32.580 --> 03:34.150
Why are you looking at me like that?

03:34.230 --> 03:35.680
I'm thinking about

03:36.320 --> 03:39.390
which part of what you said is trustworthy.

03:44.560 --> 03:46.220
It's up to you to decide.

03:50.880 --> 03:53.570
[Shao's Residence]

03:57.060 --> 03:58.510
Put them here.

04:04.090 --> 04:05.636
See if the liquor is still warm.

04:05.660 --> 04:07.460
If not, heat it up.

04:09.430 --> 04:10.226
Father.

04:10.250 --> 04:11.700
Lunch is ready.

04:15.670 --> 04:16.836
Father.

04:16.860 --> 04:18.986
Although Magistrate Shao is not an official with integrity,

04:19.010 --> 04:20.506
he's a sensible man.

04:20.530 --> 04:22.369
Don't worry too much.

04:24.940 --> 04:26.746
I just don't understand.

04:26.770 --> 04:29.836
Mr. Nangong is a genius in business.

04:29.860 --> 04:31.196
On the contrary,

04:31.220 --> 04:32.940
those bandits from Lingyuan Sect

04:32.960 --> 04:35.716
are all despicable, rude, and reckless.

04:35.740 --> 04:39.616
They don't know how to make money by doing business.

04:39.640 --> 04:42.040
So, Mr. Nangong can't be from Lingyuan Sect,

04:42.520 --> 04:45.200
right?

04:45.940 --> 04:47.530
No matter who he is,

04:47.730 --> 04:49.756
we should avoid trouble whenever possible

04:49.780 --> 04:51.910
in such a turbulent time.

04:52.100 --> 04:54.906
I think we should draw a line with him

04:54.930 --> 04:56.620
and spare all later trouble.

04:58.000 --> 05:02.086
To draw a line with him? I don't think that's a good idea.

05:02.110 --> 05:03.926
You know

05:03.950 --> 05:05.466
every time I went to Beidu to see His Majesty,

05:05.490 --> 05:07.306
I could return home safe and sound.

05:07.330 --> 05:09.856
Part of the reason is His Majesty's trust in me.

05:09.880 --> 05:11.886
But besides that, do you know how much money

05:11.910 --> 05:13.630
I used to make relevant arrangements?

05:13.670 --> 05:15.110
Do you know

05:15.130 --> 05:17.210
where the money came from?

05:17.670 --> 05:18.936
Could it be that

05:18.960 --> 05:20.606
all the businesses under your name

05:20.630 --> 05:21.916
are being managed by Nangong Fang?

05:21.940 --> 05:23.460
Yes.

05:26.110 --> 05:28.100
Can you find someone else to replace him?

05:29.960 --> 05:33.586
How about Gongquan?

05:33.610 --> 05:35.060
No.

05:36.290 --> 05:38.490
Well, sit down.

05:40.910 --> 05:42.266
Why?

05:42.290 --> 05:44.766
First of all, he's an imperial guard now.

05:44.790 --> 05:46.306
He's busy with his own duty.

05:46.330 --> 05:48.506
Even if we put that aside, he's not in Nandu now.

05:48.530 --> 05:50.450
It will take him some time to come back.

05:50.620 --> 05:51.546
Besides,

05:51.570 --> 05:53.406
this matter needs to be addressed as soon as possible.

05:53.430 --> 05:54.950
Yes.

05:55.549 --> 05:56.846
I think

05:56.870 --> 06:00.189
maybe that person can help.

06:01.620 --> 06:03.446
Bi Yuewu was detained by the government

06:03.470 --> 06:06.140
and was under heavy guard.

06:06.360 --> 06:08.716
How could she escape

06:08.740 --> 06:10.500
so easily?

06:10.560 --> 06:11.966
I have a question for you too.

06:11.990 --> 06:13.246
You promised to help me save her.

06:13.270 --> 06:14.616
But why did you kill her?

06:14.640 --> 06:15.966
I made minor sacrifices for the greater good.

06:15.990 --> 06:17.720
I had no choice.

06:19.270 --> 06:21.236
Lady Kou, what do you think of

06:21.260 --> 06:22.646
the accident last night?

06:22.670 --> 06:24.236
Was it a coincidence?

06:24.260 --> 06:26.660
Or was it designed by someone?

06:29.340 --> 06:30.586
It couldn't be a coincidence.

06:30.610 --> 06:32.490
Then who was behind it?

06:33.320 --> 06:35.356
If Prince Fu hadn't been there yesterday,

06:35.380 --> 06:38.256
Magistrate Shao would have arrested us.

06:38.280 --> 06:40.850
Yun Xiang definitely has something to do with this.

06:41.110 --> 06:43.800
But this is not like his usual style.

06:44.790 --> 06:45.966
Yes.

06:45.990 --> 06:48.546
He wouldn't want to hurt you,

06:48.570 --> 06:50.020
would he?

06:50.190 --> 06:51.666
But will Mr. Kou,

06:51.690 --> 06:54.540
who is stonehearted,

06:54.790 --> 06:56.350
be merciful to you

06:56.350 --> 06:58.126
like Yun Xiang?

06:58.150 --> 06:59.630
What do you mean?

06:59.790 --> 07:02.326
I received a secret report last night.

07:02.350 --> 07:04.836
Mr. Kou killed a bodyguard of Master.

07:04.860 --> 07:06.730
His whereabouts are still unknown.

07:10.700 --> 07:11.766
It doesn't matter anymore.

07:11.790 --> 07:13.240
Nangong Fang,

07:13.440 --> 07:14.396
I'm gonna put aside the matter of

07:14.420 --> 07:16.476
how you colluded with Prince Fu.

07:16.500 --> 07:17.926
Given the current situation,

07:17.950 --> 07:19.650
we can't stay in Nandu anymore.

07:22.370 --> 07:24.156
We are under suspicion.

07:24.180 --> 07:25.656
If the government wants to arrest us,

07:25.680 --> 07:28.446
no matter how intertwined with Prince Fu,

07:28.470 --> 07:30.220
he won't protect you.

07:30.330 --> 07:32.946
The danger in your eyes

07:32.970 --> 07:34.420
is a rare opportunity

07:34.940 --> 07:37.310
for me.

07:38.030 --> 07:39.480
So,

07:41.030 --> 07:43.540
you've long been waiting for this chaos.

07:44.370 --> 07:47.020
Maybe.

07:47.580 --> 07:49.266
Maybe not.

07:49.290 --> 07:52.566
Now, all the forces with different intentions

07:52.590 --> 07:54.510
are all here.

07:54.790 --> 07:55.996
Lady Kou.

07:56.020 --> 07:58.910
Please just wait and see.

07:59.740 --> 08:01.410
Lady Kou.

08:04.410 --> 08:05.286
Cross the river immediately

08:05.310 --> 08:06.766
and send this to Master.

08:06.790 --> 08:07.676
If anyone tries to stop you,

08:07.700 --> 08:09.286
even if it's someone in the sect,

08:09.310 --> 08:10.656
destroy it immediately.

08:10.680 --> 08:12.130
I understand.

08:25.890 --> 08:27.340
Madam Kou.

08:27.380 --> 08:30.020
Is Lady Kou in trouble?

08:31.870 --> 08:33.579
No.

08:34.069 --> 08:36.910
Instead, I think things went too smoothly.

08:37.340 --> 08:39.560
In just a few days,

08:39.799 --> 08:43.566
the business world in Nandu is almost under control.

08:43.590 --> 08:45.256
I didn't expect Nangong Fang

08:45.280 --> 08:48.230
to ally himself with Prince Fu

08:48.420 --> 08:50.340
to do business together.

08:50.640 --> 08:53.976
I think Nangong Fang knows that

08:54.000 --> 08:55.966
the sect needs his money and supplies.

08:55.990 --> 08:58.326
That's why he dared to tell Lady Kou

08:58.350 --> 09:00.150
the secret.

09:00.950 --> 09:01.896
Madam Kou.

09:01.920 --> 09:03.936
According to the sect rules, he violated a taboo.

09:03.960 --> 09:06.446
We could summon him back with this excuse

09:06.470 --> 09:07.346
and deal with him.

09:07.370 --> 09:08.686
No, Mr. Cao.

09:08.710 --> 09:10.046
We can't do this.

09:10.070 --> 09:11.756
If we kill him rashly,

09:11.780 --> 09:13.506
we'll have nowhere else

09:13.530 --> 09:14.960
to get money to sustain the sect.

09:14.980 --> 09:16.116
But if he controls Nandu,

09:16.140 --> 09:17.520
it'll be harder to deal with him.

09:17.540 --> 09:20.030
You didn't get to the crux of the matter.

09:20.470 --> 09:23.976
To achieve great things, we can't get personal.

09:24.000 --> 09:26.660
Nangong Fang is a crafty devil.

09:26.930 --> 09:29.896
It took him ten years to make plans.

09:29.920 --> 09:31.646
He designed the current situation.

09:31.670 --> 09:34.806
I thought he would do the same thing in Nandu,

09:34.830 --> 09:37.990
but I didn't expect it to be such a disaster.

09:38.450 --> 09:41.936
I think what he has done this time

09:41.960 --> 09:43.716
is quite unusual.

09:43.740 --> 09:45.966
Actually, I always feel that

09:45.990 --> 09:47.906
Nangong Fang's behavior

09:47.930 --> 09:50.550
goes against the style of the Lingyuan Sect.

09:50.980 --> 09:54.366
He's more like someone from Yuntai.

09:54.390 --> 09:55.396
Madam Kou.

09:55.420 --> 09:57.606
There must be something wrong with his unusual behavior.

09:57.630 --> 10:01.030
Is there a bigger conspiracy behind this?

10:05.000 --> 10:09.340
No matter what. There's no turning back now.

10:32.000 --> 10:32.966
Lower your voice.

10:32.990 --> 10:34.440
They are still sleeping.

10:34.590 --> 10:38.350
I wouldn't believe it if I weren't seeing this with my own eyes.

10:39.940 --> 10:41.790
We haven't seen each other for a long time.

10:41.870 --> 10:42.870
How did you get into the habit

10:42.870 --> 10:44.870
of drinking early in the morning?

10:46.210 --> 10:49.050
Even though you are having a row with that brat,

10:49.390 --> 10:51.500
you can still come to see the kids.

11:02.570 --> 11:04.550
Aren't these Yun Xiang's clothes?

11:17.050 --> 11:18.530
Still the old price, ten taels of gold, right?

11:19.040 --> 11:21.000
I want you to protect Yun Xiang.

11:29.390 --> 11:30.840
Take it.

11:33.940 --> 11:35.750
Why does it have to be me?

11:36.270 --> 11:37.686
Do me a favor.

11:37.710 --> 11:40.510
I don't want to talk to him today.

11:41.470 --> 11:44.110
You adults are so troublesome.

11:50.590 --> 11:51.356
What did you do?

11:51.380 --> 11:53.550
Tianhu doesn't want to talk to you.

11:53.940 --> 11:56.426
I'm going to stay in Liansheng House for a few days.

11:56.450 --> 11:57.900
She's not happy about it.

11:58.230 --> 11:59.906
Say something nice for me.

11:59.930 --> 12:00.766
OK.

12:00.790 --> 12:02.846
I'll take care of it.

12:02.870 --> 12:04.320
Really?

12:04.390 --> 12:05.546
Boss.

12:05.570 --> 12:07.380
I'm being serious.

12:07.710 --> 12:09.390
You are more literate than other kids here.

12:09.590 --> 12:11.040
From now on,

12:12.070 --> 12:14.056
I want you to lead other boys and girls

12:14.080 --> 12:16.210
to learn and read. Okay?

12:16.780 --> 12:18.340
No.

12:19.110 --> 12:20.560
Boss.

12:24.680 --> 12:26.200
Don't hurry to leave.

12:26.770 --> 12:28.446
I'll make you another bracelet.

12:28.470 --> 12:30.150
Boss, there's no need for that.

12:31.630 --> 12:33.630
I still keep the one you made for me last time.

12:34.390 --> 12:35.576
Listen to me.

12:35.600 --> 12:38.390
Be careful no matter how skilled you are in martial arts.

13:16.900 --> 13:19.396
I think you just can't settle down.

13:19.420 --> 13:21.526
It has only been a few peaceful days. Now you want to go out again.

13:21.550 --> 13:22.786
No.

13:22.810 --> 13:24.366
What's good about the world out there?

13:24.390 --> 13:25.606
I really have something to do.

13:25.630 --> 13:26.726
I'll be back after I'm done.

13:26.750 --> 13:27.926
I don't believe it.

13:27.950 --> 13:28.990
You said

13:28.990 --> 13:30.326
you didn't want to settle down

13:30.350 --> 13:31.576
because you were used to being adrift.

13:31.600 --> 13:33.106
Things are different now.

13:33.130 --> 13:34.740
I don't want to leave the kids...

13:36.020 --> 13:39.580
And... And you.

13:48.710 --> 13:50.160
I'm leaving.

13:51.850 --> 13:53.300
Jin.

13:54.790 --> 13:57.580
I'll wait for you to come back.

14:13.170 --> 14:13.966
Young Master.

14:13.990 --> 14:16.750
You've picked hundreds of samples from the warehouse.

14:17.830 --> 14:19.850
Of course we have to choose the best.

14:20.610 --> 14:21.396
Mrs. Su.

14:21.420 --> 14:23.726
These are all samples of every year's tribute cloth.

14:23.750 --> 14:25.246
All of them are the best.

14:25.270 --> 14:27.150
But even for different kinds of tribute cloth,

14:27.180 --> 14:28.436
there are still slight differences.

14:28.460 --> 14:29.686
That's right.

14:29.710 --> 14:30.630
Now the Su family

14:30.630 --> 14:32.366
is no longer the royal supplier.

14:32.390 --> 14:34.020
Now they are re-selecting the royal supplier.

14:34.160 --> 14:36.420
This is the only chance for us to make a comeback.

14:37.230 --> 14:39.500
We need something incomparable.

14:39.540 --> 14:42.460
The more careful we are, the bigger chance we have.

14:44.830 --> 14:46.126
This is it.

14:46.150 --> 14:47.600
Silk organza.

14:49.290 --> 14:51.050
This is silk organza?

14:52.660 --> 14:55.796
I heard that the Su family

14:55.820 --> 14:57.376
became the royal supplier because of this.

14:57.400 --> 14:58.586
That's right.

14:58.610 --> 15:01.286
The skill of producing silk organza is exclusive to our family.

15:01.310 --> 15:03.846
The weavers are getting better at making this these years.

15:03.870 --> 15:04.966
Silk organza it is.

15:04.990 --> 15:06.446
I'm confident we can win with this.

15:06.470 --> 15:08.590
You won't tell me if I don't look into this, right?

15:09.400 --> 15:10.446
Mr. Kang, don't be angry.

15:10.470 --> 15:12.660
We're just following Mr. Mo's orders.

15:13.030 --> 15:14.710
In just two days,

15:14.900 --> 15:17.630
you've deposited 150,000 taels in Dafeng Bank.

15:18.100 --> 15:19.506
Do you know

15:19.530 --> 15:20.886
you've used

15:20.910 --> 15:22.900
most of the money we have?

15:23.620 --> 15:25.800
Why are you giving him a hard time?

15:26.590 --> 15:28.040
Don't worry.

15:28.110 --> 15:30.246
I didn't use the money of the Su family,

15:30.270 --> 15:31.926
the merchants in Nandu,

15:31.950 --> 15:33.750
or our own.

15:33.780 --> 15:35.556
No matter if I can win the gamble with Nangong Fang,

15:35.580 --> 15:38.506
we won't suffer a great loss.

15:38.530 --> 15:39.516
Uncle,

15:39.540 --> 15:41.780
we are using up the money in our treasury.

15:42.660 --> 15:44.096
Get the carriage ready.

15:44.120 --> 15:45.570
Yes.

15:46.070 --> 15:47.446
Uncle.

15:47.470 --> 15:50.230
You're going to use Master Guan's money?

15:50.710 --> 15:52.870
I'll pick up the goods now.

15:53.020 --> 15:54.336
If we can launder all those goods,

15:54.360 --> 15:57.640
we can get more than 100,000 taels.

15:57.910 --> 16:00.606
With this huge amount of money, we can be assured.

16:00.630 --> 16:02.086
Even if I lose all this money,

16:02.110 --> 16:04.446
I have two years to repay Guan.

16:04.470 --> 16:05.686
Uncle,

16:05.710 --> 16:07.630
this is not your style.

16:07.710 --> 16:09.346
Why take the risk?

16:09.370 --> 16:10.876
Risk?

16:10.900 --> 16:11.966
What risk?

16:11.990 --> 16:12.626
If I win,

16:12.650 --> 16:14.186
it's Nangong Fang who should be worried.

16:14.210 --> 16:15.116
If you lose the money,

16:15.140 --> 16:16.706
I'll incite Guan

16:16.730 --> 16:18.926
to teach Nangong Fang a lesson.

16:18.950 --> 16:20.750
I don't even have to do it myself.

16:20.820 --> 16:22.270
Uncle.

16:22.530 --> 16:23.416
No matter what,

16:23.440 --> 16:25.406
we have to pay first

16:25.430 --> 16:27.826
and wait for Master Guan's money.

16:27.850 --> 16:30.716
If Master Guan breaks his promise,

16:30.740 --> 16:32.190
-then... -Shut up!

16:33.490 --> 16:34.536
Don't jinx it.

16:34.560 --> 16:36.006
Uncle.

16:36.030 --> 16:37.480
Uncle.

16:44.340 --> 16:45.860
Mr. Yun, please enjoy.

16:49.060 --> 16:51.540
Why is there only one cup?

16:52.120 --> 16:53.570
I quit drinking.

16:53.830 --> 16:54.966
You can quit drinking,

16:54.990 --> 16:56.750
but I'm afraid you can't forget her.

16:59.880 --> 17:00.866
By the way,

17:00.890 --> 17:03.370
why did you suddenly come back to Liansheng House?

17:20.340 --> 17:21.790
She got in touch with you?

17:21.820 --> 17:23.490
She also gave me some gold.

17:25.249 --> 17:28.896
Guess if she wants me to kill you

17:28.920 --> 17:30.960
or to protect you?

17:34.590 --> 17:36.230
It's a good thing if she wants you to kill me.

17:37.090 --> 17:39.080
If so,

17:39.110 --> 17:40.716
both of us can be relieved.

17:40.740 --> 17:42.486
Well, if that's the case,

17:42.510 --> 17:44.230
things will be easier for me as well.

17:46.910 --> 17:49.286
How did you two

17:49.310 --> 17:51.006
become enemies?

17:51.030 --> 17:52.286
As your enemy,

17:52.310 --> 17:54.230
she asked me to protect you.

17:54.380 --> 17:56.566
What are you doing?

17:56.590 --> 17:58.456
Can't you just

17:58.480 --> 18:00.050
talk things through?

18:05.490 --> 18:06.846
It's okay if you don't want to.

18:06.870 --> 18:08.286
Then, tell me

18:08.310 --> 18:11.100
who wants to kill you this time.

18:11.720 --> 18:13.170
Jin.

18:13.570 --> 18:15.180
It's not that I don't want to tell you,

18:15.300 --> 18:17.586
but it's too complicated.

18:17.610 --> 18:19.106
You've just lived in peace for a few days.

18:19.130 --> 18:20.626
I really don't want you to get involved in this again.

18:20.650 --> 18:21.796
It's too late.

18:21.820 --> 18:23.796
I've taken the money.

18:23.820 --> 18:25.366
I have to do my job.

18:25.390 --> 18:26.840
This is a matter of morality.

18:30.520 --> 18:32.110
Cheers.

18:32.760 --> 18:34.390
I forgot that you quit drinking.

18:37.750 --> 18:39.200
Don't worry.

18:39.970 --> 18:41.540
In the whole Nandu,

18:41.640 --> 18:43.726
few merchants can

18:43.750 --> 18:45.310
compete with us in the selection.

18:45.640 --> 18:48.240
In terms of experience and craftsmanship,

18:48.310 --> 18:51.186
we are the best.

18:51.210 --> 18:52.890
I'm not worried about other things.

18:53.750 --> 18:56.286
I'm just worried about

18:56.310 --> 18:58.390
how much money it will cost.

19:00.160 --> 19:02.160
From raw materials and weavers

19:02.250 --> 19:04.290
to networking...

19:06.070 --> 19:07.520
70,000 to 80,000 taels.

19:11.070 --> 19:13.190
I just checked the accounts.

19:13.270 --> 19:16.780
We used more than 100,000 taels

19:16.840 --> 19:18.850
to acquire the Tang family's business together with Guanghui Bank.

19:19.350 --> 19:22.190
Now we have only a few thousand taels left.

19:23.030 --> 19:24.480
Menglan.

19:24.540 --> 19:27.056
I have reached an agreement with Mr. Mo.

19:27.080 --> 19:29.910
As long as the money we need is less than 100,000 taels, we can borrow it from him anytime.

19:32.260 --> 19:35.150
[Su's Residence]

19:34.910 --> 19:36.756
You're willing to accompany me for a few days

19:36.780 --> 19:38.530
only if Yun asks you to.

19:38.590 --> 19:39.926
And now,

19:39.950 --> 19:41.910
we're going back to Liansheng House.

19:42.750 --> 19:44.566
Now, the situation is clear.

19:44.590 --> 19:47.290
Besides, you're doing well.

19:47.570 --> 19:49.726
Of course, I have to go back to Liansheng House.

19:49.750 --> 19:51.196
That is also under your name.

19:51.220 --> 19:52.860
I should put equal effort into that.

19:53.890 --> 19:56.600
But I can only feel at ease when you are with me.

20:04.030 --> 20:05.480
Mr. Su,

20:06.860 --> 20:08.176
please go to Guanghui Bank with me now.

20:08.200 --> 20:09.650
Mr. Yun has already arrived.

20:10.200 --> 20:11.650
Go now.

20:17.180 --> 20:18.750
Be careful.

20:33.150 --> 20:35.550
Master Guan vanished

20:37.500 --> 20:39.470
without a trace.

20:43.190 --> 20:46.180
You wanted to put your money into Dafeng Bank,

20:46.770 --> 20:48.610
so you could earn interest from Nangong Fang.

20:49.910 --> 20:51.850
But you were afraid Nangong Fang would

20:52.110 --> 20:54.830
persuade other merchants to withdraw money from your bank.

20:55.510 --> 20:57.520
And coincidentally,

20:57.590 --> 20:58.856
Master Guan showed up with perfect timing,

20:58.880 --> 21:01.426
enabling you to maneuver.

21:01.450 --> 21:03.540
You didn't have doubts at all?

21:06.190 --> 21:07.966
Guan and I have been doing business

21:07.990 --> 21:10.006
for over ten years.

21:10.030 --> 21:12.420
Nothing ever went wrong.

21:12.730 --> 21:13.846
Have you forgotten

21:13.870 --> 21:15.750
Kou Lianyi knows about

21:16.010 --> 21:17.660
your relationship with Master Guan?

21:17.900 --> 21:19.380
The fact that Kou Lianyi knows

21:20.350 --> 21:22.326
means Nangong Fang knows it too.

21:22.350 --> 21:24.330
Do you think I didn't think about that?

21:25.520 --> 21:26.606
It's obvious that

21:26.630 --> 21:28.006
we've been set up.

21:28.030 --> 21:28.580
Under this circumstance,

21:28.600 --> 21:30.526
you can't still trust Master Guan, can you?

21:30.550 --> 21:32.290
Over the past decades,

21:32.820 --> 21:34.630
these pirates used to be invincible

21:34.650 --> 21:36.156
at the very first.

21:36.180 --> 21:38.460
But then, they died one by one.

21:39.670 --> 21:41.990
Only Guan survived.

21:43.030 --> 21:44.510
Why's that?

21:44.950 --> 21:47.266
Because he's extremely cautious

21:47.290 --> 21:49.490
and never trusts anyone easily.

21:50.790 --> 21:52.240
You don't understand

21:52.450 --> 21:54.766
why he joined hands with Nangong Fang.

21:54.790 --> 21:56.510
I have been laundering the things he robbed

21:57.590 --> 22:00.470
for more than ten years.

22:01.030 --> 22:03.510
That's how I made friends with him.

22:04.110 --> 22:07.476
Doing business with him is highly risky.

22:07.500 --> 22:09.580
So, I'm especially careful.

22:09.670 --> 22:12.146
I bought his trusted aides

22:12.170 --> 22:13.890
to be my spy.

22:15.170 --> 22:17.410
You never knew that he is related to Lingyuan Sect?

22:17.760 --> 22:19.350
Never.

22:19.820 --> 22:21.646
Although both Lingyuan Sect and the pirates

22:21.670 --> 22:23.990
are serious troubles for the government,

22:24.460 --> 22:26.420
it brings no benefits but only harm to him

22:27.390 --> 22:29.240
if he colludes with Lingyuan Sect.

22:29.710 --> 22:32.030
The only thing Guan wants is money.

22:37.630 --> 22:39.550
Solve the problem at hand first.

22:41.520 --> 22:42.970
Do you have a plan?

22:46.340 --> 22:47.790
No.

23:04.360 --> 23:05.156
You're here too.

23:05.180 --> 23:06.630
Jin.

23:07.350 --> 23:07.916
It has been a long time.

23:07.940 --> 23:09.560
Come on, have a drink.

23:10.350 --> 23:11.996
Warrior Jin, I'll drink with you.

23:12.020 --> 23:12.856
It's urgent.

23:12.880 --> 23:13.976
Mr. Su, go to the study first.

23:14.000 --> 23:15.326
Right. Jin.

23:15.350 --> 23:16.566
Not today.

23:16.590 --> 23:17.926
Let's drink till all's blue some other day.

23:17.950 --> 23:19.830
Okay, it's a deal.

23:26.150 --> 23:27.286
What happened?

23:27.310 --> 23:29.110
Why are you all so worried?

23:33.190 --> 23:34.640
Let's drink.

23:40.630 --> 23:44.860
[Dafeng Bank]

23:43.810 --> 23:45.260
Sir.

23:48.110 --> 23:49.766
Su Mingyu went to Guanghui Bank.

23:49.790 --> 23:51.206
Kang Qiao picked him up.

23:51.230 --> 23:53.246
Should we wrap it up?

23:53.270 --> 23:54.596
Shut up!

23:54.620 --> 23:55.996
Go.

23:56.020 --> 23:57.736
Finish the things I told you to do.

23:57.760 --> 23:59.210
Yes.

24:03.950 --> 24:05.706
Lady Kou, in your opinion,

24:05.730 --> 24:09.010
is this a good time to wrap things up?

24:10.010 --> 24:11.620
I never thought

24:11.790 --> 24:14.950
even the vicious pirates could be used by you.

24:15.430 --> 24:16.910
You're the biggest contributor to this.

24:17.010 --> 24:18.910
Of course you have the right to decide.

24:19.830 --> 24:21.066
Talking about contributions,

24:21.090 --> 24:23.846
I need to thank you for your detailed information.

24:23.870 --> 24:25.950
Otherwise, how could I design this sophisticated plan

24:25.970 --> 24:27.476
to kill two birds with one stone,

24:27.500 --> 24:29.980
destroying the Su family and Mo Bufan?

24:31.660 --> 24:32.780
My informants

24:32.800 --> 24:35.530
didn't know much about their alliance.

24:36.040 --> 24:38.090
Thanks to your advice,

24:38.430 --> 24:39.350
I know that

24:39.350 --> 24:41.196
they've put their money together.

24:41.220 --> 24:43.000
If I defeat Mo Bufan,

24:43.270 --> 24:45.710
the Su family will suffer a lot.

24:53.870 --> 24:55.910
I know the whole story now.

24:56.320 --> 24:58.800
But Mr. Mo, you're shrewd. Yun, you're cautious.

24:59.070 --> 25:01.150
How could you fall into the trap?

25:01.700 --> 25:03.150
It's not his fault.

25:04.520 --> 25:07.890
I was so angry that I made reckless decisions.

25:08.060 --> 25:10.640
I wanted to ask for your help with the money

25:11.510 --> 25:13.060
needed for the royal supplier selection.

25:13.280 --> 25:14.730
But now...

25:15.430 --> 25:17.326
The Chamber of Commerce was disbanded,

25:17.350 --> 25:18.806
but I still have some business friends.

25:18.830 --> 25:21.606
I can raise some money in three days

25:21.630 --> 25:23.286
to fill the hole.

25:23.310 --> 25:24.856
If we can get three days to react,

25:24.880 --> 25:26.800
everything can be solved.

25:27.320 --> 25:29.940
But Nangong Fang won't give us the chance.

25:30.690 --> 25:33.096
I think tomorrow morning,

25:33.120 --> 25:35.210
Guanghui Bank will be swamped by merchants

25:35.230 --> 25:36.680
who want to withdraw their money.

25:37.200 --> 25:38.650
Or maybe

25:39.850 --> 25:41.580
they'll come earlier than that.

25:42.350 --> 25:43.990
Then do something.

25:45.300 --> 25:46.750
There is nothing I can do.

25:48.230 --> 25:49.740
We are now in a corner.

25:50.180 --> 25:52.520
What we need to do now

25:52.720 --> 25:54.290
is to make sacrifices to regain our advantage.

25:55.180 --> 25:58.196
We have no other choice now.

25:58.220 --> 26:00.060
In this situation,

26:01.500 --> 26:03.660
we can only rip off the arm to save the body.

26:05.310 --> 26:07.906
I have 50 to 60 thousand taels of silver left in my treasury.

26:07.930 --> 26:09.336
Move the money to the Su family overnight.

26:09.360 --> 26:10.766
Pull through the competition first.

26:10.790 --> 26:12.240
What about you?

26:12.860 --> 26:14.370
Hide

26:16.000 --> 26:19.830
and start all over again when things cool off.

26:23.060 --> 26:25.690
My reputation is completely ruined.

26:25.910 --> 26:27.986
I'll work behind the scenes,

26:28.010 --> 26:29.920
while Kang Qiao takes the steering wheel.

26:30.070 --> 26:31.790
That's one way out.

26:33.390 --> 26:35.270
But no matter what,

26:35.350 --> 26:37.276
you must capture the position

26:37.300 --> 26:38.950
of the royal supplier.

26:39.510 --> 26:41.300
Only when the Su family secures its place,

26:41.790 --> 26:43.830
I can turn the tables as soon as possible.

26:44.530 --> 26:45.980
Besides,

26:46.070 --> 26:49.150
this amount of money is just a drop in the bucket

26:50.870 --> 26:52.830
to the crisis that Guanghui Bank is facing.

26:54.570 --> 26:56.020
Be quick.

27:08.630 --> 27:11.710
Lady Kou, what are you thinking?

27:12.650 --> 27:14.100
I'm thinking

27:14.500 --> 27:16.116
if you dare to be so rude again,

27:16.140 --> 27:18.560
I will punish you severely.

27:21.800 --> 27:23.396
We haven't won yet.

27:23.420 --> 27:25.100
Don't get carried away.

27:26.430 --> 27:28.030
Why did you say so?

27:28.940 --> 27:30.326
The Su family has a solid foundation.

27:30.350 --> 27:31.806
Even if it suffers huge losses,

27:31.830 --> 27:34.510
it may not fail in the royal supplier selection.

27:39.720 --> 27:42.390
You are really thorough.

27:42.480 --> 27:44.896
But I've also thought of this

27:44.920 --> 27:47.336
and planned to take the chance tonight

27:47.360 --> 27:50.870
to destroy the Su family completely.

27:51.550 --> 27:54.320
The help from Lingyuan Sect should be here soon.

28:18.430 --> 28:19.880
Oh, my!

28:20.190 --> 28:21.426
This huge amount of money

28:21.450 --> 28:24.380
is enough for Jishan Hall to operate for hundreds of years.

28:26.850 --> 28:29.720
Now I know why you all look so worried.

28:30.030 --> 28:33.000
Is it that you don't know how to spend all this money?

28:34.310 --> 28:36.110
Are there still rooms available in Jishan Hall?

28:36.280 --> 28:37.730
What do you mean?

28:39.270 --> 28:41.040
I'm afraid after tonight,

28:41.430 --> 28:43.116
I'll need to

28:43.140 --> 28:45.090
live off your support.

28:45.490 --> 28:46.940
No...

28:48.570 --> 28:50.020
Are you done?

28:51.520 --> 28:52.936
I can't help much here.

28:52.960 --> 28:54.246
Take good care of Mr. Mo

28:54.270 --> 28:55.720
and wait for a chance to turn things around.

28:55.950 --> 28:57.400
Got it.

29:06.870 --> 29:07.486
Mr. Mo,

29:07.510 --> 29:08.960
the carts are ready.

29:18.360 --> 29:19.910
You've been running

29:20.950 --> 29:22.990
Guanghui Bank for 20 years.

29:23.220 --> 29:24.670
It is

29:27.900 --> 29:29.350
what it is.

29:31.960 --> 29:36.550
I'll get back the money I've lost.

29:39.980 --> 29:41.430
Let's go.

30:00.230 --> 30:01.056
Let us in.

30:01.080 --> 30:01.526
Yes.

30:01.550 --> 30:03.030
Let us in.

30:03.800 --> 30:05.920
Open the door! Open the door!

30:12.480 --> 30:13.656
I want to withdraw my money.

30:13.680 --> 30:15.130
I want to withdraw my money.

30:15.420 --> 30:16.870
Quiet!

30:16.960 --> 30:18.440
Quiet!

30:18.800 --> 30:20.620
You are all frequenters.

30:21.430 --> 30:23.830
Why did you break into Guanghui Bank at night?

30:23.920 --> 30:26.886
You don't care about the law

30:26.910 --> 30:30.190
and our relationship at all?

30:31.030 --> 30:32.426
Why are you counting out money

30:32.450 --> 30:35.140
in the middle of the night?

30:35.520 --> 30:37.726
It seems that we're here at the right time, right?

30:37.750 --> 30:38.500
Yes.

30:38.520 --> 30:40.750
That's right.

30:41.200 --> 30:42.516
Let me go straight to the point.

30:42.540 --> 30:43.556
Mr. Kang,

30:43.580 --> 30:45.846
we are here for only one thing.

30:45.870 --> 30:49.166
We just want to withdraw

30:49.190 --> 30:50.296
the money we've deposited in Guanghui Bank.

30:50.320 --> 30:52.546
We want our money! We want our money!

30:52.570 --> 30:54.846
No bank will let you withdraw money in the middle of the night.

30:54.870 --> 30:56.390
Get out!

30:56.760 --> 30:57.636
If you want to withdraw money,

30:57.660 --> 30:59.520
come back tomorrow morning.

30:59.700 --> 31:01.976
I don't think we can find you tomorrow morning.

31:02.000 --> 31:02.926
Right?

31:02.950 --> 31:03.790
That's right.

31:03.810 --> 31:05.260
Give me my money!

31:06.200 --> 31:08.350
Money! Money!

31:08.660 --> 31:10.726
Chairman Su is really here.

31:10.750 --> 31:11.756
Mr. Nangong was right.

31:11.780 --> 31:12.336
Mr. Mo...

31:12.360 --> 31:14.170
Isn't this an inside job?

31:14.660 --> 31:16.980
Why are they staring at me?

31:17.350 --> 31:18.796
This doesn't look good.

31:18.820 --> 31:21.350
Well said.

31:23.410 --> 31:28.980
This is indeed an inside job.

31:29.230 --> 31:30.680
Nangong Fang,

31:31.110 --> 31:33.350
don't go too far.

31:33.950 --> 31:36.256
What have I done?

31:36.280 --> 31:39.646
I just want to seek justice

31:39.670 --> 31:40.516
for the merchants in Nandu.

31:40.540 --> 31:41.990
Enough.

31:43.370 --> 31:45.090
Who gives you, an outsider, the right

31:45.500 --> 31:47.926
to butt in on affairs of the business world in Nandu?

31:47.950 --> 31:49.326
Mr. Su,

31:49.350 --> 31:51.670
you sound righteous.

31:51.760 --> 31:54.406
But your behavior is inconsistent with your words.

31:54.430 --> 31:57.056
It seems that the government's decision

31:57.080 --> 31:58.776
to disband the Chamber of Commerce saved merchants like us.

31:58.800 --> 32:00.456
Yes, it should have been closed long ago.

32:00.480 --> 32:01.930
Right?

32:15.090 --> 32:16.750
They actually dare to mug the bank

32:16.860 --> 32:20.256
in Nandu.

32:20.280 --> 32:21.950
This is not the worst.

32:22.500 --> 32:24.140
Those who passed us just now

32:24.360 --> 32:26.460
are the most famous merchants in the city.

32:30.070 --> 32:32.150
This is Nangong Fang's trump card.

32:33.660 --> 32:35.110
What do you mean?

32:37.470 --> 32:39.880
Just tell me. Should we go back?

32:42.830 --> 32:44.280
It's not the time yet.

32:45.430 --> 32:46.880
Just wait.

32:51.820 --> 32:53.300
You deposited 150,000 taels of silver

32:53.320 --> 32:55.506
into Dafeng Bank these days.

32:55.530 --> 32:58.006
You used the money entrusted to you

32:58.030 --> 32:59.796
by these merchants to earn interest from my bank.

32:59.820 --> 33:00.826
I don't think it's appropriate.

33:00.850 --> 33:03.120
Mr. Mo, do you admit it or not?

33:03.890 --> 33:06.160
It doesn't matter if he admits it or not.

33:06.230 --> 33:07.726
That's only one way to do business.

33:07.750 --> 33:08.670
If Guanghui Bank

33:08.670 --> 33:11.420
can cash out your deposits today,

33:11.670 --> 33:13.710
everything will be fine.

33:13.900 --> 33:16.220
But in the past few months,

33:16.260 --> 33:18.380
Mr. Mo and Mr. Su

33:18.400 --> 33:20.176
have been acquiring a lot of businesses in Nandu.

33:20.200 --> 33:22.860
That cost hundreds of thousands of taels.

33:23.060 --> 33:25.230
I'm afraid there's not much money left

33:25.700 --> 33:27.620
in the treasury.

33:32.150 --> 33:33.686
As you can see,

33:33.710 --> 33:35.736
if you had come a little bit later,

33:35.760 --> 33:37.926
the last two boxes of silver

33:37.950 --> 33:40.710
would have been sent to the Su family secretly.

33:41.110 --> 33:42.656
Next,

33:42.680 --> 33:45.446
the money you've worked hard to earn

33:45.470 --> 33:49.460
will vanish together with Mr. Mo.

33:51.110 --> 33:52.036
Well,

33:52.060 --> 33:54.550
he has the Su family to support him,

33:54.630 --> 33:58.160
so he'll be fine for the rest of his life.

34:02.830 --> 34:04.550
Don't listen to his nonsense.

34:04.740 --> 34:06.076
Think about it.

34:06.100 --> 34:08.390
With so many businesses under Guanghui Bank,

34:08.670 --> 34:10.560
even if it is short of money,

34:11.190 --> 34:13.056
can't it run normally?

34:13.080 --> 34:15.275
This man is inciting you to create a bank run

34:15.299 --> 34:16.956
to suppress Guanghui Bank.

34:16.980 --> 34:18.366
If Guanghui Bank doesn't have enough money,

34:18.390 --> 34:20.260
it is breaking the rules of this industry.

34:20.420 --> 34:23.855
You have only yourselves to blame.

34:23.879 --> 34:25.870
The Su family has been doing business for about 100 years.

34:26.900 --> 34:29.030
I'm willing to vouch for Mr. Mo with my family's goodwill.

34:29.350 --> 34:32.110
Isn't it more trustworthy than what he said?

34:33.250 --> 34:36.040
Goodwill?

34:36.710 --> 34:40.010
Mo Bufan is emptying the treasury in the middle of the night.

34:40.350 --> 34:42.590
Do you dare to say it has nothing to do with you?

34:43.060 --> 34:44.420
Everybody can see that.

34:44.420 --> 34:45.870
You...

34:46.500 --> 34:47.275
Check!

34:47.299 --> 34:48.286
I dare you!

34:48.310 --> 34:50.749
I dare you!

35:03.870 --> 35:04.300
Uncle.

35:04.320 --> 35:05.386
It's useless.

35:05.410 --> 35:06.860
Well said. A bet is a bet.

35:07.470 --> 35:10.300
I admire that you can accept defeat with good grace.

35:11.300 --> 35:13.246
Su Mingyu, remember this.

35:13.270 --> 35:15.646
When tempted by money,

35:15.670 --> 35:17.516
these people

35:17.540 --> 35:19.500
won't stay sensible.

35:23.100 --> 35:24.550
Kang Qiao!

35:26.130 --> 35:27.580
Let's go.

35:38.860 --> 35:40.036
Mr. Mo,

35:40.060 --> 35:41.756
you shouldn't stay in Guanghui Bank now.

35:41.780 --> 35:43.086
Leave now.

35:43.110 --> 35:44.560
Go.

35:47.000 --> 35:48.366
According to what you said,

35:48.390 --> 35:50.366
Guanghui Bank will be doomed.

35:50.390 --> 35:51.846
Who is Nangong Fang?

35:51.870 --> 35:52.950
He actually got the better of you.

35:52.950 --> 35:53.696
Also,

35:53.720 --> 35:55.366
how did Shu Yanan become Kou Lianyi

35:55.390 --> 35:56.846
and switch to the side of your enemy?

35:56.870 --> 35:58.166
This is too complicated.

35:58.190 --> 35:59.950
-I'll tell you another day. -No.

36:00.240 --> 36:01.770
Not another day.

36:09.640 --> 36:10.406
Mr. Yun.

36:10.430 --> 36:12.366
The girl who kept losing last time came again.

36:12.390 --> 36:13.526
She brought two other people

36:13.550 --> 36:15.070
and insisted on waiting for you.

36:16.600 --> 36:17.926
Who are they?

36:17.950 --> 36:19.246
I think they're up to no good.

36:19.270 --> 36:21.186
It's fine. Go upstairs and rest.

36:21.210 --> 36:22.660
I can handle it.

36:32.340 --> 36:33.486
Mr. Yun,

36:33.510 --> 36:35.380
finally, you're back.

36:38.750 --> 36:41.590
Greetings, Your Highness.

36:43.700 --> 36:45.346
How do you know he's Prince Fu?

36:45.370 --> 36:47.170
Aren't you afraid that you might get his identity wrong?

36:48.250 --> 36:50.210
Is this Mr. Yun?

36:50.630 --> 36:52.080
He's Yun Xiang.

36:52.520 --> 36:54.006
Just as I heard,

36:54.030 --> 36:55.590
you have good graces.

36:58.430 --> 37:00.070
Your Highness, I reckon you are here

37:00.150 --> 37:02.470
for the accident last night.

37:04.850 --> 37:06.256
You asked Magistrate Shao

37:06.280 --> 37:08.406
to let the female assassin of the Lingyuan Sect go

37:08.430 --> 37:11.146
to catch her accomplices.

37:11.170 --> 37:13.010
You are quite bold.

37:13.510 --> 37:15.526
Nangong Fang works for me.

37:15.550 --> 37:17.510
As you're going after him,

37:17.640 --> 37:19.600
you are against me.

37:32.560 --> 37:34.916
The weather is dry.

37:34.940 --> 37:37.860
Beware of fire.

37:39.120 --> 37:40.876
I didn't expect you and I

37:40.900 --> 37:43.790
to hit it off straight away.

37:43.860 --> 37:46.820
It's already midnight.

37:47.040 --> 37:48.706
Luckily, Mingzhu has gone back home.

37:48.730 --> 37:49.810
Otherwise, it would be too late for her to go to bed

37:49.830 --> 37:52.536
and she'd definitely get mad at me during the day.

37:52.560 --> 37:54.286
It's my honor

37:54.310 --> 37:55.990
to resonate with Your Highness.

37:56.950 --> 37:59.510
It's settled then.

37:59.510 --> 38:00.960
Deal.

38:01.230 --> 38:04.170
I'll see you off when you leave.

38:04.620 --> 38:06.180
Don't bother, Your Highness.

38:06.900 --> 38:09.380
Alright, you don't need to walk me out.

39:20.350 --> 39:24.590
They've got the money they want.

39:25.690 --> 39:27.750
Why did they have to destroy the place?

39:28.370 --> 39:30.156
We always

39:30.180 --> 39:31.356
ingratiate ourselves

39:31.380 --> 39:32.686
with those merchants

39:32.710 --> 39:34.310
and be polite to them.

39:35.080 --> 39:36.670
The moment we got into trouble,

39:36.920 --> 39:38.690
they changed attitudes.

39:40.220 --> 39:41.670
Forget it.

39:42.540 --> 39:43.990
Forget it.

39:44.910 --> 39:46.710
It's human nature.

39:48.000 --> 39:49.810
It's human nature.

39:52.290 --> 39:53.740
Uncle,

39:53.900 --> 39:55.246
let's go.

39:55.270 --> 39:57.630
More people will come to ask for their money.

39:57.830 --> 40:00.830
I'm afraid we can't get away if we delay.

40:02.560 --> 40:04.010
Let's go.

40:07.720 --> 40:09.170
Go.

40:14.290 --> 40:15.740
Go.

40:18.430 --> 40:19.880
Let's go.

40:27.190 --> 40:28.206
Mingyu,

40:28.230 --> 40:31.190
it's not that we don't want to lend you the money.

40:31.610 --> 40:35.046
Given what happened in Guanghui Bank last night,

40:35.070 --> 40:38.086
if we lend you the money now,

40:38.110 --> 40:41.310
we're standing against all the merchants in Nandu.

40:41.430 --> 40:42.676
To be honest,

40:42.700 --> 40:45.380
given that you sent out dozens of invitations,

40:45.690 --> 40:47.556
the fact that the three of us can come

40:47.580 --> 40:49.960
is for old times' sake.

40:50.510 --> 40:53.420
Now the Su family is at stake.

40:53.510 --> 40:55.126
If you are willing to help,

40:55.150 --> 40:57.946
I will do my best to help you if you need me in the future.

40:57.970 --> 41:01.286
Mingyu, take my advice.

41:01.310 --> 41:04.706
Your priority now is to make clarifications

41:04.730 --> 41:06.206
and restore your reputation.

41:06.230 --> 41:07.726
Only after that

41:07.750 --> 41:11.190
can we help you.

41:14.210 --> 41:15.660
Young Master.

41:15.900 --> 41:17.990
A girl surnamed Kou is here to see you.

41:54.710 --> 41:56.160
Sister.

41:56.440 --> 42:00.740
Mingyu told me about what happened recently.

42:00.950 --> 42:01.860
No one expected

42:01.880 --> 42:04.010
this would happen.

42:05.230 --> 42:07.686
If you have any difficulties,

42:07.710 --> 42:09.470
can you tell me?

42:10.100 --> 42:12.110
We are both women.

42:12.250 --> 42:14.080
Maybe I can understand.

42:16.420 --> 42:17.970
It is what it is.

42:18.590 --> 42:20.690
Anything I say would only be excuses.

42:20.950 --> 42:22.560
You'd better not ask.

42:23.670 --> 42:26.030
You burned down Yufeng Warehouse

42:27.580 --> 42:29.640
and almost destroyed the Su family.

42:30.870 --> 42:32.806
And now you're on Nangong Fang's side.

42:32.830 --> 42:35.790
You finally got what you wanted.

42:38.230 --> 42:41.380
Tell me, what else do you want?

42:44.130 --> 42:46.830
Mr. Nangong wants to buy the craftsmanship of silk organza.

43:07.990 --> 43:10.326
I know what you're up to.

43:10.350 --> 43:11.820
Go back and tell him

43:12.590 --> 43:15.900
I won't give it to him even if it's lost.
